# Public, non-secret build-time configuration only. NEVER put secrets here.
#
# Browser-facing control-plane API base. DEFAULT is the same-origin relative path `/api`,
# which the reverse proxy routes to the internal control-plane container (the control plane is
# never published to the host). Leave this as `/api` for both local development and production
# single-host deployments served behind the proxy. Do NOT set an absolute internal host such as
# http://127.0.0.1:8100 — it would be compiled into the frontend, fail in the browser, and break
# the SameSite=lax HttpOnly session cookie + CSRF same-origin model.
VITE_CONTROL_PLANE_BASE_URL=/api
